LORE.push(
  {ch:437, n:'Declared Alive', t:'After months in Dragonvale preparing Roc and Delilah\'s wedding, the party returned to Tribute, where King Hugh restored Levi Stanson\'s legal status as a living nobleman and voided deceased and missing. His family will be informed and will inevitably learn he is alive.'},
  {ch:438, n:'The Name Stanson', t:'With his name restored, Jade told Levi that Stanson carries obligations to family, allies and the realm, including the engagement between their houses, arranged in childhood as an alliance and not a romance. Levi admitted he had avoided thinking of home, and that his family would now come.'},
  {ch:439, n:'A Son Returned', t:'The court\'s notice reached House Stanson, and its head ordered a summons. The letter told Levi to present himself to discuss succession, family obligations and his years of absence. It was cold, a notice of duty and not a welcome.'},
  {ch:440, n:'Sally Comes to Tribute', t:'After a brief return to Dragonvale, Sally came to Tribute at last, offering her agents, friends and tavern cover to the investigation and to Levi\'s family problem: courts keep records, and taverns keep the truth.'},
  {ch:441, n:'The House That Mourned Him', t:'Levi returned to the Stanson estate. His parents, who had believed him dead and prepared themselves for years, received him with restraint: you are still a Stanson, and actions matter more than words from now on.'},
  {ch:442, n:'Years Missing', t:'At the Stanson estate Levi told his family the truth about his years away: at first he could not return, because of danger, injury and loss, and later he was unwilling, from shame. Some of that time was forced on him, and some was his choice.'},
  {ch:443, n:'The Childhood Contract', t:'An old handwritten agreement between the Gold and Stanson families, from when Jade and Levi were five or six, wished that their children might marry one day. It was never signed and never binding, and it stays in the family archives as a piece of the past.'},
  {ch:444, n:'Everywhere, a Matchmaker', t:'Once Levi was declared alive and unmarried, matchmakers, noble houses and merchant families flooded him with candidates and gifts. He said he was not a trade agreement, and wished he had stayed a mystery.'},
  {ch:445, n:'Not the Vacancy', t:'When a matchmaker treated the place beside Levi as a position any woman could fill, Sally said she was not a position and asked what Levi was offering anyone. She did not want to claim him; she refused to be the convenient woman chosen to fill the vacancy, and told him to ask whether he wanted a wife or only wanted the vacancy gone.'},
  {ch:446, n:'The Duties They Never Heard About', t:'At House Stanson the family brought ancestral robes, household records and marriage arrangements. Jade told them Levi is still a Noble Archer, a field operative and a permanent member of the travelling party hunting the remaining Fifteen Evils. Levi said he came home to reconnect, not to retire from his life.'}
);

/* ---- Arc XVIII, chapters 447-452: Linse, Orchid and Zhaohua ---- */
deed('hz_zhaohua', 'story', 'My little sister survived', '🌸', 'Orchid was confirmed as Princess Zhaohua, Sally\'s sister.', () => !!G.flags.zhaohua_confirmed);
LOCATIONS.stanson_estate.spots.push(
  {id:'hz447a', kind:'investigate', n:'Records from Before the Fall', icon:'📚', ch:447, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'At the Stanson estate.',
   clues:['At the Stanson estate, old records are opened once more. Among the ledgers, a familiar name appears. Jade: "These are the estate records from before the kingdom fell. Some survived the war... and were brought here."', '"There are mentions of people who sought refuge after the fall, using different names."'], rw:{xp:433100, gold:88920}},
  {id:'hz447b', kind:'investigate', n:'A Different Name', icon:'🔖', ch:447, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Linse.',
   clues:['"This name... Lysenne. It appears here in the early years after the kingdom fell. But this record uses a different name." Jade: "Same handwriting style as the other royal household records."', '"This is not Sally\'s name. It refers to an older woman."'], rw:{xp:433400, gold:88980}, needFlag:'inv_hz447a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz447c', kind:'investigate', n:'Madame Linse', icon:'🚢', ch:447, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'The southern ports.',
   clues:['Sally: "She used another name here... Linse. There are trade records and warehouse payments to a \'Madame Linse\' in the southern ports. The timeline matches the years after the kingdom fell."', 'Levi: "So Lysenne survived... And she was deliberately living under a different identity."'], rw:{xp:433700, gold:89040}, needFlag:'inv_hz447b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz447d', kind:'investigate', n:'A Longer Road', icon:'🗺️', ch:447, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'A network across several ports.',
   clues:['Devon: "Do we know where this \'Madame Linse\' went next?" Sky: "There are records of shipments, medical supplies, and correspondence. She moved often. It looks like she maintained a network across several ports."', '"The trail is still fragmented, but it gives us a direction. She was helping people relocate, possibly nobles, scholars... and others from the old kingdom." Lysenne. A different name. A longer road.'], rw:{xp:434000, gold:89100}, needFlag:'inv_hz447c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
);
LOCATIONS.capital.spots.push(
  {id:'hz448a', kind:'investigate', n:'A Woman in the Western Quarter', icon:'🏮', ch:448, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Under a common name.',
   clues:['The trail leads the party to a woman living under the western name Orchid. She remembers the fall of Lysenne clearly. Levi: "The records lead to a woman named Orchid. She lives quietly in the western quarter under a common name, but the details match the lead from the old ledger."', 'Sky: "Orchid was there when Lysenne fell?"'], rw:{xp:434300, gold:89160}},
  {id:'hz448b', kind:'investigate', n:'I Was There', icon:'🕯️', ch:448, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Some things never leave you.',
   clues:['Orchid: "Yes. I was there. I knew the royal family of Lysenne. I used a different name after the fall... Orchid." Jade: "Please tell us what you remember. Anything, even small details, may help us."', 'Orchid: "It has been many years... But some things never leave you."'], rw:{xp:434600, gold:89220}, needFlag:'inv_hz448a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz448c', kind:'investigate', n:'Betrayals Within', icon:'⚔️', ch:448, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'The kingdom did not fall in a night.',
   clues:['Orchid: "The kingdom was not destroyed in a single night. There were warnings. Betrayals. And people within our own ranks who opened the way."', '"I remember the child... A small royal child, smuggled out during the chaos. She was not with the main group. I was entrusted to take her to safety for a short distance... but the world changed too quickly. I lost sight of her after that."'], rw:{xp:434900, gold:89280}, needFlag:'inv_hz448b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz448d', kind:'investigate', n:'A Flower Like This', icon:'🌸', ch:448, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'A symbol.',
   clues:['Orchid: "She was alive when I last saw her. I do not know who took her next, or what name she was given." Sally: "Do you remember anything about the people who took her? A location? A name? A symbol?"', 'Orchid: "There was a woman... from outside Lysenne. A trader, perhaps. Or an intermediary. She used a different name then, but there was a symbol I recall... a flower like this."'], rw:{xp:435200, gold:89340}, needFlag:'inv_hz448c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz449a', kind:'investigate', n:'Proof She Never Expected', icon:'📜', ch:449, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'A sketch.',
   clues:['Orchid: "It has been so many years... I never thought I would see proof of her again. This is Zhaoning. My little sister. I was told she died during the fall of Lysenne."', 'Sally: "You are... Princess Zhaohua? ...You are my older sister?"'], rw:{xp:435500, gold:89400}},
  {id:'hz449b', kind:'investigate', n:'The Records Match', icon:'🔎', ch:449, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'A princess of Lysenne.',
   clues:['Jade: "The records match. Zhaohua is listed as a princess of Lysenne, and she later disappeared under a different name in the west." Orchid: "I believed you had died, Zhaoning."', 'Zhaohua: "I used a different name after the fall. Orchid. I buried who I was so that I could survive."'], rw:{xp:435800, gold:89460}, needFlag:'inv_hz449a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz449c', kind:'investigate', n:'A Missing Part of Myself', icon:'💭', ch:449, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'She does not remember.',
   clues:['Sally: "I... I do not remember you, Sister. But hearing this... it feels like a missing part of myself, even if I cannot remember."', 'Zhaohua: "I understand. You have lived a different life. The past cannot be changed. But knowing you may have survived... It overturns everything I thought I accepted."'], rw:{xp:436100, gold:89520}, needFlag:'inv_hz449b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz449d', kind:'investigate', n:'You Survived', icon:'🌸', ch:449, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'The sisters.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "Zhaoning... I always believed you were gone. But you are here. Even if you do not remember me..."', '"My little sister... you survived."'], rw:{xp:436400, gold:89580}, needFlag:'inv_hz449c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz450a', kind:'investigate', n:'A Truth She Never Dared to Hope For', icon:'🕯️', ch:450, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Not royal politics.',
   clues:['For Zhaohua, this is not a matter of royal politics. It is simply the truth she never dared to hope for. Her little sister survived.', 'Zhaohua: "It has been so many years... I never thought I would see proof of her again. My little sister... she survived?"'], rw:{xp:436700, gold:89640}},
  {id:'hz450b', kind:'investigate', n:'I Believed You Had Died', icon:'💔', ch:450, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'She tried to let go.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "I believed you had died, Zhaoning. For so many years... I told myself I must accept it. I must let you go. But you... you are here."', 'Sally: "I... I do not remember you, Sister. But somehow... it feels like I should."'], rw:{xp:437000, gold:89700}, needFlag:'inv_hz450a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz450c', kind:'investigate', n:'Lily, Sally Sin, Sally Sun', icon:'🌸', ch:450, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'What she remembers.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "I was not with you when you were taken from Lysenne... I was entrusted to keep you safe... but the world changed too quickly. I thought... I thought I had lost you forever."', 'Sally: "I do not remember the childhood you speak of... But I can feel how much you cared for me. I do not remember being a princess. I do not remember being a sister. I remember Lily... Then I became Sally Sin. Later, Sally Sun."'], rw:{xp:437300, gold:89760}, needFlag:'inv_hz450b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz450d', kind:'investigate', n:'You Are Still Here', icon:'🌙', ch:450, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'That is enough.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "It is all right. You do not need to remember now. You are still here. That is enough for me."', '"My little sister... You are alive. That is all that matters right now." Not as the princess lost in the past, but as the person she has become. The past is real, but it no longer defines them.'], rw:{xp:437600, gold:89820}, needFlag:'inv_hz450c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz451a', kind:'investigate', n:'Do You Not Remember Me at All?', icon:'💬', ch:451, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Zhaohua asks.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "Look at me, Sally. Truly look at me. I am Zhaohua. Your older sister. Do you not remember me at all?"', 'Sally: "...I\'m sorry. I... I do not remember you, Sister. No matter how hard I try, it feels like a stranger."'], rw:{xp:437900, gold:89880}},
  {id:'hz451b', kind:'investigate', n:'These Are the Lives I Remember', icon:'🪞', ch:451, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Lily, Sally Sin, Sally Sun.',
   clues:['Sally: "I do not remember being a princess. I do not remember being your little sister. I do not remember the fall of Lysenne. I do not remember that life at all. I was Lily. Then I became Sally Sin. Later, Sally Sun. These are the memories I have. This is who I was. These are the lives I remember."', 'Zhaohua: "All this time... I thought you had died that night. I have held your memory for so many years... And now you are here, but you do not remember me..."'], rw:{xp:438200, gold:89940}, needFlag:'inv_hz451a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz451c', kind:'investigate', n:'A Story About Someone Else', icon:'💭', ch:451, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'It hurts, but she understands.',
   clues:['Sally: "It is not that I do not believe you. I can see how much you care for me. But I truly do not remember. Even when you tell me these things... it feels like I am hearing a story about someone else."', 'Zhaohua: "...It hurts. But I understand. You lost your little sister. And now the person in front of you does not remember that bond. I know this must be difficult."'], rw:{xp:438500, gold:90000}, needFlag:'inv_hz451b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz451d', kind:'investigate', n:'Not as a Memory, but as You', icon:'🤝', ch:451, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Time.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "I will not force you to remember. You are not just the child I lost. You are the person you became. Lily. Sally Sin. Sally Sun. All of those are part of who you are now."', 'Sally: "I know it may take time. I may never remember the past... But I would like to know you now. Not as a memory, but as you." Zhaohua: "Then let me do this. If you do not remember being my little sister... Let me get to know the sister you are now." Sally: "...Thank you, Sister. I may not remember the past... But I will try."'], rw:{xp:438800, gold:90060}, needFlag:'inv_hz451c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz452a', kind:'investigate', n:'You Do Not Need to Be Zhaoning', icon:'🌸', ch:452, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'What she wants.',
   clues:['Zhaohua accepts that she cannot restore the past by force. Instead of asking Sally to become Zhaoning again, she chooses to meet the sister in the present. Zhaohua: "You do not need to be Zhaoning. You do not need to carry the past for me. What I want... is to meet you."', 'Sally: "...Zhaohua. I am still me. I do not remember being your little sister, but I... I am here now, as I am."'], rw:{xp:439100, gold:90120}},
  {id:'hz452b', kind:'investigate', n:'Tell Me About Sally', icon:'🍵', ch:452, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Who my sister became.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "Then don\'t be her. Let me learn who my sister became. Tell me about Sally." Sally: "You want to know about me... Truly? Even though I cannot give you the memories you lost?"', 'Sally: "I was Lily. A girl who had to start over. Then I became Sally Sin. I learned to survive. I made my own choices. Later, Sally Sun. I built a new life. A name I could call my own."'], rw:{xp:439400, gold:90180}, needFlag:'inv_hz452a', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz452c', kind:'investigate', n:'The Same Person', icon:'🪞', ch:452, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'Different names.',
   clues:['Sally: "And now... I am simply Sally. All of these are me. Different names, different places... but the same person."', 'Zhaohua: "Then let me meet that person. Not through memories... but here, in the present." Sally: "...I would like that. I want to try."'], rw:{xp:439700, gold:90240}, needFlag:'inv_hz452b', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
  {id:'hz452d', kind:'investigate', n:'Two Women Choosing', icon:'🌙', ch:452, need:2, ambush:[], lo:96, roles:['jade', 'levi', 'sally', 'devon'],
   desc:'To become sisters again.',
   clues:['Zhaohua: "My little sister... You survived. And now, let me walk forward with you. Tell me everything you are willing to share. Your travels, your friends, your dreams... I want to get to know Sally. In this time. At your pace."', 'The past left wounds that cannot be erased. But in the present, a new bond begins. They are no longer only the sisters separated by loss, but two women choosing, slowly, to become sisters again.'], rw:{xp:440000, gold:90300}, needFlag:'inv_hz452c', lockMsg:'🔒 Finish the previous clue first'},
);
